118
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:06,180
Start Nginx on the same network with the configuration mounted read-only (:ro) as its default site:

119
00:10:06,733 --> 00:10:10,272
The hostname is the PHP container's ID:

120
00:10:10,272 --> 00:10:14,718
Nginx received the request, PHP-FPM ran the code.

